
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#07111f">
<meta name="description" content="NEXORA explores artificial intelligence, quantum computing, and emerging technologies.">
<title>NEXORA — Intelligence for What Comes Next</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#07111f;--panel:#101e32;--text:#f4f7ff;--muted:#a9b8cf;--cyan:#68e4ff;--purple:#a59aff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0%,#282052 0,transparent 40%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.7 system-ui,Arial,sans-serif}
.wrap{width:min(1100px,90%);margin:auto}
header{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff1c}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:5px}
nav a,.links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px}
.hero{padding:100px 0 85px;max-width:900px}
.tag{color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,78px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:22px 0}
.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));color:transparent;background-clip:text}
p{color:var(--muted)}
.lead{font-size:19px;max-width:680px}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin:15px 10px 0 0;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #ffffff30;color:var(--text)}
.primary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));color:#07111f;border:0}
section{padding:55px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(29px,5vw,44px);line-height:1.2}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:18px;padding:25px}
.card .symbol{font-size:30px;color:var(--cyan)}
.card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:5px}
.banner{padding:30px;border:1px solid #ffffff25;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#68e4ff13,#a59aff16)}
footer{border-top:1px solid #ffffff20;padding:28px 0;margin-top:40px;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:65px 0}nav a{margin-left:8px;font-size:13px}.logo{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:3px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
